{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國中期選舉再爆出驚人大冷門，並迎來歷史性的一刻。在傳統深紅州份密西西比州，43歲的民主黨籍地方檢察官科洛姆（Scott Colom）擊敗現任共和黨參議員海德-史密斯（Cindy Hyde-Smith），成功奪下該州聯邦參議院席位。科洛姆不僅成為該州近40年來首位民主黨籍聯邦參議員，也是美國內戰後重建時期以來，140多年間首位當選參議員的非裔美國人。</p><p>英國廣播公司（BBC）報道，選舉夜過去8天後，統計約99%選票的結果顯示，科洛姆以49.2%對48.7%的得票率微弱領先，雙方差距僅為4585票。</p><p>競選期間，身為地方檢察官的科洛姆主打經濟民生牌，猛攻對手支持特朗普（Donald Trump，又譯川普）政府的關稅政策，並給對手貼上「高價Cindy」的標籤；而海德-史密斯則因捲入「蛋白質過多」等失言風波及低調競選備受批評。海德-史密斯周三在社交平台X上發布影片承認敗選。</p><figure><img alt=\"U.S. Senate Minority Leader Chuck Schumer (D-NY) speaks at a press conference following the weekly policy luncheon, more than a month into the ongoing U.S. government shutdown on Capitol Hill in Washington, D.C., U.S., November 4, 2025. REUTERS/Annabelle Gordon\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251108/1063707240931790848231765.jpeg/TMrLwsFY-zmrFYJEs5_Que1eI09LugYPwiu3-sIrt_o\"/><figcaption>U.S. Senate Minority Leader Chuck Schumer (D-NY) speaks at a press conference following the weekly policy luncheon, more than a month into the ongoing U.S. government shutdown on Capitol Hill in Washington, D.C., U.S., November 4, 2025. REUTERS/Annabelle Gordon</figcaption></figure><p>預測結果公佈後，參議院民主黨領袖舒默（Chuck Schumer）在社交平台X上發文表示祝賀。隨着密西西比州席位易主，民主黨在在100席的參議院中已手握55席，共和黨佔44席，只餘下阿拉斯加州一席尚未揭曉。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T04:24:06.580936+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":753,"images":1,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T04:13:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:57:30.522786+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T04:17:20.679010+00:00","content_hash":"cfb3705a4ecaac7eaa2bb965d9f65e2908e27a100652847c7d49f85f9438e1f5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}